step_details.raw_response:
Thought: Test a simple robust mean over the full pool to see baseline performance.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"mean","pool":"pool_full"}

Thought: Test a weighted combination using inverse error to see if it improves over the plain mean baseline.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"weighted","pool":"pool_full","weights":"inverse_error"}

Thought: Test a robust median combination over the full model pool to see if it improves over the mean baseline.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"median","pool":"pool_full"}

Thought: Try a trimmed mean on the full pool to see if trimming high-error models improves over the plain mean baseline.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"trimmed_mean","pool":"pool_full","trim_pct":0.2}

Thought: Test a DBA combination on the full pool to see if it improves over the mean baseline.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"dba","pool":"pool_full","dba_max_iter":30}

Thought: Test the best single model hypothesis by evaluating ARIMA alone to see if a single strong model beats the mean baseline.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"best_single","model":"ARIMA"}

Thought: Test a weighted combination using the pooled_meta_model weights (w1) on a reduced robust pool (pool1) to see if a different weighting scheme improves over the current best single ARIMA.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"weighted","pool":"pool1","weights":"w1"}

Thought: Test a weighted combination on the slightly larger pool2 using inverse_error to see if adding ONLY_DWT_catboost improves over the best single ARIMA.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"weighted","pool":"pool2","weights":"inverse_error"}

Thought: Test a weighted combination on the restricted pool1 using inverse_error weights to see if a more focused weighted average improves over the best single ARIMA.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"weighted","pool":"pool1","weights":"inverse_error"}

Thought: Test a simple mean over the reduced pool1 to see if averaging fewer correlated models improves over weighted schemes.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"mean","pool":"pool1"}

Thought: Test a trimmed mean on the reduced pool1 to see if trimming the two worst models improves over the mean and weighted schemes.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"trimmed_mean","pool":"pool1","trim_pct":0.2}

Thought: Try a median combination over the reduced, low‑correlation pool1 to see if a robust non‑linear aggregator beats the best single model.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"median","pool":"pool1"}

